WEBVTT

00:31:29.862 --> 00:31:32.145
And there's a depth
that comes later in the book

00:31:32.169 --> 00:31:34.863
as the woman gets older
and her life takes on resonance,

00:31:34.887 --> 00:31:38.821
but at its heart, it is a book
about a kind of wild,

00:31:38.845 --> 00:31:40.951
romping celebration of life,

00:31:40.975 --> 00:31:45.155
and it remained that even
in the wake of Rayya's death.

00:31:45.179 --> 00:31:46.349
CA: So that's amazing,

00:31:46.373 --> 00:31:50.508
because a big theme of your work 
and your thinking about creativity

00:31:50.532 --> 00:31:55.682
has been to push back against this notion
of the dark night of the soul

00:31:55.706 --> 00:31:58.578
is what is needed for someone
to do anything great

00:31:58.602 --> 00:32:00.411
in terms of art or creativity.